{"id": "msg_f9c023a32cce4d7aae746aa0727966e6", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "Now I understand the format. Two sheets: \"本周工作总结\" and \"下周工作计划\". Columns: 序号, 负责人, 项目名称, 分支名称, 禅道ID, 工作内容, 开始时间, 结束时间, 完成时长(h), 任务类型, 目前进度, 备注.\n\nLet me check the existing prior-week file (2026.10.26-10.30) to see the established convention for this exact template — that's the most reliable reference."}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_00_6vIT8R8tjFviHq3ivGYQ9304", "tool_name": "pwsh", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"command": "cd \"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\Documents\\deepseek-harness\\default-workspace\"; $f=(Resolve-Path \".\\研发-前端-田野-本周工作总结(2026.10.26-10.30).xlsx\"); Add-Type -AssemblyName System.IO.Compression.FileSystem; $z=[System.IO.Compression.ZipFile]::OpenRead($f); foreach($n in @(\"xl/sharedStrings.xml\",\"xl/worksheets/sheet1.xml\",\"xl/worksheets/sheet2.xml\")){ $e=$z.Entries|Where-Object{$_.FullName -eq $n}; $sr=New-Object System.IO.StreamReader($e.Open()); Write-Output \"`n===== $n =====\"; Write-Output $sr.ReadToEnd(); $sr.Close() }; $z.Dispose()", "description": "Dump prior week xlsx"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-06T08:00:50.469Z", "peer_id": "deepseek-harness-default-workspace"}
