{"id": "msg_a7c4cb0c8ef94bf9926593af8f938cc0", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "The format is crystal clear (encoding garbled in console but structure is evident). Now I understand:\n- **Sheet「本周工作总结」**: header row1 merged title `研发部YYYY.MM.DD 至 YYYY.MM.DD 工作总结`, row2 headers, data rows with 序号 auto, 负责人=田野, 项目名称, 分支名称, 禅道ID(BugXXXX/任务XXXX), 工作内容【项目】标题, 开始/结束时间(date), 完成时长(h), 任务类型(BUG修复/功能开发/版本迁移/其他), 目前进度(1 or 0.5), 备注.\n\nNow let me query ZenTao for 田野's bugs/tasks resolved this week. First find user id and query."}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_00_l2pdZNecQQeCP9VIMWVJ2032", "tool_name": "mcp_gateway", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"arguments": {"connection_id": "4027e274-2f63-49e6-8a8d-5f25eb1e6c5e", "sql": "SELECT id,account,realname FROM zt_user WHERE realname LIKE '%田野%' OR account LIKE '%tianye%'"}, "server": "dbx", "tool": "dbx_execute_query"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-06T08:01:03.526Z", "peer_id": "deepseek-harness-default-workspace"}
