{"id": "msg_13ab0ca9f85b498db4287e6c17f16242", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_00_XRYtBlLJ3zMOwtsmDaIQ9762", "tool_name": "mcp_gateway", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"context-mode 有 11 个工具（省略 tool 参数即本清单）：\\n- ctx_execute: Run code in a sandboxed subprocess. (Bun detected — JS/TS runs 3-5x faster) Languages: javascript, shell, typescript, python.\\n- ctx_execute_file: Read a file into a sandboxed FILE_CONTENT variable and run code over it. Only what you console.log() enters your conversation — the file bytes stay in the sa...\\n- ctx_index: Store content in a searchable knowledge base (BM25 over FTS5). Splits markdown by headings, keeps code blocks intact, and persists the raw chunks. The full c...\\n- ctx_search: Search a unified knowledge base with a multi-strategy ranking pipeline. Two parallel matchers run on every query: a Porter-stemming matcher (\\\"caching\\\" finds ...\\n- ctx_fetch_and_index: Fetches URL content, converts HTML to markdown (JSON is chunked by key paths, plain text indexed directly), persists it in a searchable knowledge base, and r...\\n- ctx_batch_execute: Run multiple commands in ONE call. Every command's output is auto-indexed into the knowledge base; if you also pass `queries`, the matching sections come bac...\\n- ctx_stats: Returns context consumption statistics for the current session. Shows total bytes returned to context, breakdown by tool, call counts, estimated token usage,...\\n- ctx_doctor: Diagnose context-mode installation. Runs all checks server-side and returns a plain-text status report with [OK]/[FAIL]/[WARN] prefixes (renderer-safe across...\\n- ctx_upgrade: Upgrade context-mode to the latest version. Returns a shell command to execute. You MUST run the returned command using your shell tool (Bash, shell_execute,...\\n- ctx_purge: DESTRUCTIVE: permanently delete indexed content. Cannot be undone. Requires confirm:true and exactly one scope.\\n- ctx_insight: Opens the context-mode Insight dashboard (https://context-mode.com/insight) in your default browser — a dashboard launcher for the hosted analytics layer, no...\\n\\n要调用其中某个，传 tool=<名字> 和 arguments=<参数对象>。\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_13ab0ca9f85b498db4287e6c17f16242", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 1984, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-06T08:05:31.735Z", "peer_id": "deepseek-harness-default-workspace"}
