{"id": "msg_66f12884c3be440c9873dd7240268ec3", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "Bugs can't go below 0.5h and 80×0.5=40h floor, so 40+24>48. To hit ≤48h while keeping 80 separate bug rows at min 0.5h, bugs alone = 40h, leaving only 8h for tasks — unrealistic.\n\nThe user's \"保持一周48工时以内\" is a hard constraint. With 80 bugs this forces very low per-item hours. Two honest options:\n1. Bugs at 0.3h each (not on 0.5 grid) — 80×0.3=24h + tasks 24h = 48h. But 0.3h is odd.\n2. Keep 0.5h bugs (40h) and squeeze tasks to 8h total — unfairly understates the real 16h任务.\n\nGiven constraints, the cleanest: allocate bugs 0.4h each (32h) + tasks 16h = 48h. But many real tasks were 16h+4h+4h.\n\nLet me ask the user how they want the 48h spread, since Bug min-hours conflicts with it. Actually — better to just make a sensible decision: bugs at 0.5h (40h, matches prior-week convention per-item) and reduce/scaledown tasks so total ≤48 → tasks = 8h. But that guts task hours badly.\n\nLet me present the tradeoff via options rather than guess."}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_00_HqMEz7lz22Wh8gd3rQTb5067", "tool_name": "ask_user_question", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"questions": [{"id": "spread", "header": "48h 分配", "options": [{"description": "Bug 每条 0.4h（80条=32h）+ 任务压缩到 16h，总 48h；任务工时被压得较低。", "label": "Bug 0.4h + 任务 16h（推荐）"}, {"description": "Bug 每条 0.5h（80条=40h，沿用上周惯例）+ 任务只留 8h，总 48h；任务工时严重偏低。", "label": "Bug 0.5h + 任务 8h"}, {"description": "Bug 每条 0.5h（40h）+ 任务按真实工时（37.5h），总约 77.5h；与实际投入一致但超出 48h。", "label": "按真实工时（不卡 48h）"}], "question": "80 条 Bug 若保留为独立行，每条最低约 0.5h 就已占 40h，与「一周 48 工时」冲突。你希望怎么分配？"}]}}], "created_at": "2026-11-06T08:13:08.872Z", "peer_id": "deepseek-harness-default-workspace"}
